     => structurally Delta_S=0 for |S| > 10 (<= 6? False)

(4) Direct confirmation: for a deep base, drive Delta_S nonzero up to m*.
  Probe overlap at t->0 for base=(1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7): do ALL danger arcs cover t=0?
